                                                "sense_id": "83a59dde-4c06-3570-bb9c-35f39532065a",
                                                "text": "If our criterion for extra remuneration is enduring greater personal sacrifice than others, then logic requires that we compare the medical student's discomfort to whatever levels of discomfort others are experiencing who work while the medical student is in school."
